    "body": "Local dry run of this head (M5). The linux release job ran on a Linux host with rpmbuild (Ubuntu 26.04): cargo build --release, then scripts/package-linux.sh and scripts/package-appimage.sh with the pinned linuxdeploy. The run made all four packages: tar.gz, deb, rpm and AppImage. `rpm -qpl` lists all 7 hicolor icons, and the RPM build passes. The package checks of release.yml also pass on these files: camcraft-ui in the tar.gz, deb and rpm, the AppImage ELF compare, and the themes directory. This is not a release.yml run. It used the same commands.",
